                        <h1>TAKE THE TAC CHALLENGE</h1><p>Total Archery Challenge created the greatest outdoor sporting event in the United States. We combined all the exciting aspects of shooting archery shooting to bring you an unforgettable three-day experience. It’s like we always say “Life… &nbsp;It’s better with a bow.” &nbsp;TAC&nbsp;events are held in the most scenic venues across the United States, including the top of the mountains in Utah, The Black Hills of South Dakota, the northern woods of Michigan, and many other locations.</p><p>We professionally design our archery courses to test the marksmanship of all skill levels. Each event includes over 100 3D targets which challenge shooters to adjust for distances, angles and natural obstacles. In addition to our main courses, we have other novelty shots to win major prizes like a new truck.. Come test your skills against the mountain, check out what events are coming near you. We will see you on the mountain. Want more info, check out our FAQS page or What to expect within each event page.</p><h2>NOCK TIME™ CONTINUES FOR 2027</h2><p>In order to continue to make Total Archery Challenge the&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration:underline">greatest 3D archery experience that exists</span>, we will continue using Nock Time™ (tee times).<br/>There is limited space for each Nock Time™ and they are organized by course.</p><p>What this means for you:</p><ul><li>You will need to select the day, starting window and course for each day you are there, you DO NOT need to register for more than one Nock Time™ per day.</li><li>You can still shoot more than one course per day if time permits.</li><li>We have limited the amount of people that will be attending each day.</li><li><strong>Once Nock Times™ are sold out, the event is sold out.</strong></li><li>We only Allow a MAX of 6 Shooters in a Group.</li></ul>
